# *.md
.dockerignore

# Local docs — working context, quotes, client replies, internal notes and
# session logs. None of it belongs in the repo: this directory holds pricing
# (docs/QUOTE-*.md, docs/CLIENT_RESPONSE-*.md), internal-only assessments
# (docs/michael-feedback-*-internal.md) and live credentials
# (docs/internal/testing/testing-credentials.md).
#
# Blanket ignore, session logs included — Hafsa's decision, 26 August 2026.
# Note this form cannot be undone for a single child path: re-allowing one
# subfolder later means going back to `docs/*` plus a `!docs/<folder>/` line.
docs/

# Firestore snapshots taken before a migration (scripts/backup-firestore.ts).
# These contain live student data — never commit them.
backups/
